Rāma asks earlier stronger Laṅkā Rākṣasas --- Brahmā creates guardians from waters --- Rakṣāma speakers become Rākṣasas, Yakṣāma Yakṣas --- Hēti weds Kāla sister Bhayā --- Hēti son Vidyutkēśa weds Sandhyā daughter --- Sālakaṭaṅkaṭā bears and abandons wailing infant --- Śiva makes infant mother-aged and immortal --- Śiva grants sky city, Umā grants instant birth growth